{"parse": {"title": "PD-15", "pageid": 144782, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/PD-14\" title=\"PD-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PD-15</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.8E.9F.E5.AD.90.E8.A7.82.E7.85.A7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"原子观照\">原子观照</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 原子观照</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Nature of Being</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>前<span class=\"color-value\"></span>方<span class=\"color-value\"></span>仍<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>数<span class=\"color-value\"></span>次<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>飞<span class=\"color-value\"></span>跃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 38510116</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_18\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-s02_bg_18.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-s02_bg_18.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-s02_bg_18.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……这确实出乎意料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人看着手上的啁啾表，集体发出了叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这就是“全景观测空间”中的氢电池吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>它的造型很独特，我想技术也一定很独特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不，这只是一只有录音功能的表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哈哈哈，输入和输出差别巨大，这也是戈德堡机械与蝴蝶效应的魅力之一！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>从那一边带回来的机器人用氢电池，回到这里后就变成了啁啾表，我想这个变换过程也是一种惊喜收获！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>确实是很有趣的现象，如果我参与实验的话，会变成什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我会保留活塞部分，机器部分像你们的衣物一样发生转变吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>为什么不试试呢？只要我们再启动一次机器，这次就当是给露西女士准备的假日旅行……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>那么我会为几位申请正式的观光客身份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯仪中出现了左伶与右伶的面孔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>感谢两位的提案，但我接下来还要关怀回归的组员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>X的身体还需要全面检查，作为支持他行动的前上司，我也应该负起一些责任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哈哈哈……我想，留一些聚合物在体内也没什么不好的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>非特殊情况下，人道主义总是在第一位的，X研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>那我们可以走一个尽量简短的流程？观察装置的另一端随时都可能发生变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我可不想成为妨碍露西女士假日旅行的罪人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你得接受全套检查。在病床上慢慢和露西女士交流你的科技收获，如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>好吧，这下只能服从命令了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不必灰心，既然发生变化的时点是随机的，那么也可能不会发生变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我先把X押送到康复中心，露西女士，为了合理利用时间，您可以稍后直接过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>归来的访客们再次充满了干劲，他们收拾好关于“聚合物”的各项实验报告，向康复中心进发了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人的脚步轻快，研究室很快安静了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>您和您的研究员们的关系十分融洽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>谢谢。这侧面印证了我对人道主义的研究更进了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我已经阅读了维尔汀他们的探险报告，你们的世界令我学到了很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我设想过很多种未来的可能性，但技术的发展总是出现在出乎意料的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-314913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-314913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-314913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>你是对的，在聚合物被发明前，从没有人想象过进步会以这种形式到来，也不会想到它能拯救如此多的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>生存是进步的最大动力，我们为此赞美牺牲者，但畏惧和厌恶死亡也并不可耻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>真正该警惕的是停止前进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>即使在前进路上犯了错误，也仍有修正的机会，失败的经验与牺牲者都会帮助后来者走得更远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这是一条没有尽头的道路，所以注定会有人不断掉队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但我相信人们在这条路上的行进速度一定会越来越快，掉队者也会越来越少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-314912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>就像是进化论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>恐怕我们已经超越了进化论，由智慧与思考引发的进步早就超越了自然选择的理论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>露西摘下面具，看着这副出于人道主义而制造的面容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>云淡风轻，日光晴朗，无机物在思考生命。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "PD-15"}}